            <title>[ZEPPELIN-30] interpreter.json should be saved in $ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-30</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The path for &lt;tt&gt;interpreter.json&lt;/tt&gt; is actually hardcoded in &lt;tt&gt;ZeppelinConfiguration.getInterpreterSettingPath()&lt;/tt&gt;. I would expect to see this file in &lt;tt&gt;$ZEPPELIN_CONF_DIR&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
